# Map Images — DM Palette Curation
# Optional. Map's "Add image" tool auto-discovers every supported image
# under public/images/ and shows them alphabetically.
# Use this file to pin specific images to the top in chosen order
# (curated entries first; auto-discovered files appended) and/or
# override displayed labels.
# To activate: cp docs/map_images_config.yaml.example data/map_images.yaml
#
# Each entry:
#   src   — Path under /images/ (must start with /images/).
#   label — Tooltip shown to DM. Defaults to filename without extension.
# Supported: .png .jpg .jpeg .gif .webp. Each token renders at one grid
# square (50 viewBox units), snapping to the clicked square's center.

- label: Lysander
  src:   /images/Lysander.webp

- label: Olga
  src:   /images/Olga.webp

- label: Stumpy
  src:   /images/Stumpy.webp

- label: Cottonballs
  src:   /images/Cottonballs.webp
